<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-paper text-ink font-body">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <% if (found) { %>
      <section aria-labelledby="detail-title" class="py-10">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-5">
          <a href="/produk" class="text-sm font-bold text-spice hover:underline">&larr; Kembali ke Produk</a>
        </nav>

        <article class="bg-white border-2 border-ink rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-wrap gap-10" style="box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 0 #1c2b22;">
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-[200px] flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="w-40 h-40 rounded-full bg-market-light border-2 border-ink flex items-center justify-center text-7xl" aria-hidden="true">📦</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-[2] min-w-[280px]">
            <span class="inline-block bg-tag text-ink text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 -rotate-1 border-2 border-ink"><%= product.category %></span>
            <h1 id="detail-title" class="font-display font-black text-3xl mb-2"><%= product.name %></h1>
            <p class="font-display font-black text-3xl text-spice mb-3">Rp <%= product.price.toLocaleString('id-ID') %></p>
            <p class="mb-5 text-sm">Stok tersedia: <strong class="text-market-dark"><%= product.stock %></strong> unit</p>
            <p class="text-ink/75 mb-6 leading-relaxed"><%= product.description %></p>

            <aside aria-label="Catatan" class="bg-market-light border-2 border-dashed border-market rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink/70">
              <p>Ingin memesan? Fitur checkout akan tersedia di sesi berikutnya. Sementara ini kamu bisa hubungi toko lewat WhatsApp.</p>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
    <% } else { %>
      <section aria-labelledby="not-found-title" class="text-center py-24">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-5 rounded-full bg-spice/10 border-2 border-dashed border-spice flex items-center justify-center text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🔎</div>
        <h1 id="not-found-title" class="font-display font-black text-2xl mb-3">Produk Tidak Ditemukan</h1>
        <p class="text-ink/70 mb-6">Maaf, produk dengan ID tersebut tidak ada dalam data kami.</p>
        <a href="/produk" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold bg-spice text-paper border-2 border-ink hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">Kembali ke Daftar Produk</a>
      </section>
    <% } %>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
